REM FreeDOS(98) configuration example for the PC-98 TSR client.
REM The normal IME bridge client is a TSR loaded by AUTOEXEC.BAT.
REM No DEVICE line is required for IME98TSR.COM.

FILES=30
BUFFERS=20
LASTDRIVE=Z

REM IME98.SYS is a diagnostic skeleton, not the interactive IME client.
REM Enable this only when explicitly testing the device-driver diagnostics.
REM DEVICE=Z:\IME98.SYS
